{
  "_comment": [
    "The option texts of the custom mood slots (custom_mood_<n>_*) and of every mood's placement helper (input_select.moods_<slug>_where). Frozen: lint.js fails if one is renamed or removed, or if a new one is not listed here.",
    "A chosen option that disappears falls back to the first one after a restart (a step silently becomes No step), and the phones match the placement texts word for word.",
    "To add an option: append it in ui/dev/gen-custom.js (and moods_settings.yaml for where) and append it here, in the same change. Never rename or reorder.",
    "The input_select.moods_<slug>_look / _bed lists are the built-in moods' settings (moods_settings.yaml): the same rules, and \"Custom (sliders below)\" stays last (a new preset goes just before it, here and there). A chosen option must survive every update."
